{"id": "13-2667-2-8", "zh": "bhuj 等词根（的末音）连同 ssa 一起，可选地变为 kkhaṅa。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-2667-9-39", "zh": "如 abhokkhā（＝abhuñjissā）、bhokkhati（＝bhuñjissati）、amokkhā（＝amuñcissā）、mokkhati（＝muñcissati）、avakkhā（＝avacissā）、vakkhati（＝vaccissati）、pāvekkhā（＝pāvisissā）、pavekkhati（＝pavisissati）；由于拆分规则（yogavibhāga），vis 在其他场合也可以变为 kkhaṅa：pāvekkhi、pāvisi。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-2668-2-7", "zh": "28. 在 ā 等、ī 等词尾前，har（的末音）变为 ā。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "13-2669-2-9", "zh": "在 ā 等、ī 等词尾前，har（的末音）可选地变为 ā。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "13-2669-10-15", "zh": "如 ahā、aharā，ahāsi、ahari。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2670-2-6", "zh": "29. gam 也是这样。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2671-2-9", "zh": "在 ā 等、ī 等词尾前，gam（的末音）可选地变为 ā。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-2671-10-15", "zh": "如 agā、agamā，agā、agamī。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2672-2-8", "zh": "30. ḍaṃs（的末音）也变为 chaṅa。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-2673-2-9", "zh": "在 ā 等、ī 等词尾前，ḍaṃs 与 gam（的末音）可选地变为 chaṅa。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-2673-10-21", "zh": "如 aḍañchā、aḍaṃsā，aḍañchi、aḍaṃsī，agañchā、agacchā，agañchi、agacchī。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2674-2-8", "zh": "31. 在 ssati 等词尾前，hū 变为 he、hehi、hohi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2675-2-6", "zh": "在 ssati 等词尾前，hū 变为 he 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2675-7-12", "zh": "如 hessati、hehissati、hohissati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2676-2-7", "zh": "32. 在 ṇā、nā 前变为短音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2677-2-7", "zh": "在 kṇā、knā 前，动词词根（的元音）变为短音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2677-8-11", "zh": "如 kiṇāti、dhunāti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2678-2-12", "zh": "33. ā、ī、ū、mhā、ssā、ssamhā 可选地（变为短音）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "13-2679-2-6", "zh": "这些词尾可选地变为短音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2679-7-24", "zh": "如 gama、gamā，gami、gamī，gamu、gamū，gamimha、gamimhā，gamissa、gamissā，gamissamha、gamissamhā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2680-2-7", "zh": "34. kus、ruh 后面的 ī 变为 chi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2681-2-10", "zh": "kus 与 ruh 后面的 ī 可选地变为 chi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2681-11-16", "zh": "如 akkocchi、akkosi，abhirucchi、abhiruhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2682-2-9", "zh": "35. a 等、ī 等、ssā 等词尾的辅音前，加 iña。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-2683-2-10", "zh": "在动词词根后面的 a 等、ī 等、ssa 等词尾中，辅音前可选地加 iña。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-2683-11-24", "zh": "如 babhuvittha、abhavitthā、anubhavissā，anubhavissati、anubhossati，harisati、hassati。为什么说“这些词尾”？", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-2683-25-29", "zh": "如 bhavati。为什么说“辅音”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2683-30-31", "zh": "如 babhūva。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2684-2-7", "zh": "36. brū 后面的 ti 加 īña。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2685-2-8", "zh": "brū 后面的 ti 可选地加 īña。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2685-9-12", "zh": "如 bravīti、brūti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2686-2-6", "zh": "37. kya 也是这样。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2687-2-8", "zh": "动词词根后面的 kya 可选地加 īña。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2687-9-12", "zh": "如 pacīyati、paccati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2688-2-21", "zh": "38. eyyātha、sse、a、ā、ī、tha 依次变为 o、a、aṃ、ttha、ttho、vhoka。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "13-2689-2-7", "zh": "eyyātha 等依次可选地变为 o 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2689-8-50", "zh": "如：你们 bhaveyyātho（＝bhaveyyātha），你 abhavissa（＝abhavisse），我 abhavaṃ（＝abhava），他 abhavittha（＝abhavā），他 abhavittho（＝abhavī），你们 bhavathavho（＝bhavatha）。这里取的是与 ā 相伴出现的 a 词尾；而 tho 因为在末尾标出，只与 tyādi 词尾相关，或者说因为它依附于那个词尾；设置这种依附，也是经文作者的惯用做法。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "13-2690-2-7", "zh": "39. uṃ 变为 iṃsu、aṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2691-2-7", "zh": "词尾 uṃ 可选地变为 iṃsu、aṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2691-8-13", "zh": "如 agamiṃsu、agamaṃsu、agamuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2692-2-7", "zh": "40. 在 e、o 后面，（uṃ）变为 suṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2693-2-10", "zh": "在替换而成的 e 和替换而成的 o 后面，uṃ 可选地变为 suṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2693-11-20", "zh": "如 nesuṃ、nayiṃsu，assosuṃ、assuṃ。经文用 tta，是为了表明（e、o）是替换音。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "13-2694-2-7", "zh": "41. hū 后面（的 uṃ）变为 resuṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2695-2-8", "zh": "hū 后面的 uṃ 可选地变为 resuṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2695-9-12", "zh": "如 ahesuṃ、ahavuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2696-2-10", "zh": "42. o 变为 a、i、ttha、ttho。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2697-2-6", "zh": "o 可选地变为 a 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2697-7-16", "zh": "如：你 abhava、abhavi、abhavittha、abhavittho（＝abhavo）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-2698-2-6", "zh": "43. si。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2699-2-6", "zh": "o 可选地变为 si。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2699-7-10", "zh": "如：你 ahosi（＝ahuvo）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-2700-2-7", "zh": "44. 长音后面的 ī（变为 si）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2701-2-8", "zh": "长音后面的 ī 可选地变为 si。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2701-9-14", "zh": "如 akāsi、akā，adāsi、adā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2702-2-6", "zh": "45. mhā、ttha 加 uña。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-2703-2-6", "zh": "mhā、ttha 可选地加 uña。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "13-2703-7-12", "zh": "如 agamhamhā、agamimhā，agamuttha、agamittha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-2704-2-8", "zh": "46. iṃ 也加 siña。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2705-2-8", "zh": "iṃ 可选地加 siña；mhā、ttha 多数情况下也是这样。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-2705-9-16", "zh": "如 akāsiṃ、akariṃ，akāsimhā、akarimhā，akāsittha、akarittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2706-2-6", "zh": "47. eyyuṃ 变为 uṃ。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-2707-2-6", "zh": "eyyuṃ 可选地变为 uṃ。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "13-2707-7-9", "zh": "如 gacchuṃ、gaccheyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2708-2-7", "zh": "48. a 后面的 hi 脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2709-2-8", "zh": "a 后面的 hi 可选地脱落。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-2709-9-14", "zh": "如 gaccha、gacchāhi。为什么说“在 a 后面”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-2709-15-16", "zh": "如 karohi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2710-2-7", "zh": "49. 在 ssa 前，kya（脱落）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2711-2-7", "zh": "在 ssa 前，kya 可选地脱落。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-2711-8-13", "zh": "如 anvabhavissā、anvabhūyissā，anubhavissati、anuchūyissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-2712-2-12", "zh": "50. atthi 后面的 eyya 等六个词尾，变为 sa、su、sa、satha、saṃ、sāma。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2713-2-10", "zh": "在表示“有”义的 as 词根后面，eyya 等六个词尾依次变为 sa 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-2713-11-22", "zh": "如 assa、assu、assa、assatha、assaṃ、assāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2714-2-6", "zh": "51. 前两个变为 iyā、iyuṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2715-2-9", "zh": "atthi 后面 eyya 等六个词尾中，最前面的两个依次变为 iyā、iyuṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2715-10-13", "zh": "如 siyā、siyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "13-2716-2-7", "zh": "52. t 变为 th。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-2717-2-8", "zh": "atthi（as）后面的 t 音变为 th。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-2717-9-12", "zh": "如 atthi、atthu。", "confidence": 90}
